umber","min":0,"required":true,"aria_label":"Number of employees with a contract in this country"}],"footer":["employees_by_country_sum","employees_country_delta"],"note":"Σ over the rows → employees_by_country_sum (VSME-B08.200-D1); employees_country_delta = NumberOfEmployees − Σ (VSME-B08.200-D2) is the consistency check against the B01.000 total — manual_required until NumberOfEmployees is inherited here (vsme-C-9). The one-row scalar NumberOfEmployeesForCountryOfEmploymentContract stays (vsme-D-30). Country tokens = prod CountryOfSite (identical to CountryOfPrimaryOperationsAndLocationOfSignificantAssets, pinned)."}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, (SELECT COALESCE(MAX(order_index), 0) + 1 FROM fields f3 WHERE f3.worksheet_template_id = w.id), true
